{"kind":"html","caption":"先排序为 [-4,-1,-1,0,1,2]，依次固定一个数，再用左右指针寻找另外两个数。三数之和偏小时右移左指针，偏大时左移右指针，等于 0 时记录答案并跳过重复值。示例最终得到两个不重复三元组 [-1,-1,2] 和 [-1,0,1]。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>三数之和可视化</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.title{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;margin:0}.step{color:#3794ff;font-size:10px}.source{margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.mono,.cell,.sum,.answer{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.track{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;margin:8px 0;overflow:hidden}.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;width:0;transition:width .45s ease}.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,38px);gap:6px;margin-top:8px}.slot{text-align:center}.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;font-size:14px;transition:.35s}.idx{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:4px}.tag{height:14px;margin-bottom:2px;font-size:10px;color:transparent;transition:.35s}.slot.fixed .cell{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.slot.left .cell{border-color:#4ec9b0;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #4ec9b0}.slot.right .cell{border-color:#ce9178;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #ce9178}.slot.fixed .tag{color:#75beff}.slot.left .tag{color:#4ec9b0}.slot.right .tag{color:#ce9178}.math{margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.sum{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center}.reason{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.reason strong{color:#d4d4d4}.answers{margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid #3c3c3c;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px}.answer{padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-size:13px;opacity:.25;transform:scale(.96);transition:.35s}.answer.on{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}.legend{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:4px}.fixedDot{background:#3794ff}.leftDot{background:#4ec9b0}.rightDot{background:#ce9178}</style></head><body><main><div class=\"top\"><div class=\"title\">排序 + 固定一个数 + 双指针</div><div class=\"step\" id=\"step\"></div></div><div class=\"source\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">[-1,0,1,2,-1,-4]</span> → 排序后</div><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\"></div></div><div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div><div class=\"math\"><div class=\"sum\" id=\"sum\"></div><div class=\"reason\" id=\"reason\"></div></div><div class=\"answers\"><span>已收集：</span><span class=\"answer\" id=\"a1\">[-1,-1,2]</span><span class=\"answer\" id=\"a2\">[-1,0,1]</span></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot fixedDot\"></i>固定值 i</span><span><i class=\"dot leftDot\"></i>左指针 L</span><span><i class=\"dot rightDot\"></i>右指针 R</span></div></main><script>const nums=[-4,-1,-1,0,1,2];const frames=[{i:0,l:1,r:5,s:-4,msg:'和小于 0，说明需要更大的数：<strong>L 向右移动</strong>',n:0},{i:0,l:2,r:5,s:-4,msg:'仍小于 0，继续让 <strong>L 向右移动</strong>',n:0},{i:0,l:3,r:5,s:-2,msg:'仍小于 0，继续缩小搜索区间',n:0},{i:0,l:4,r:5,s:-1,msg:'仍小于 0；本轮指针相遇，没有答案',n:0},{i:1,l:2,r:5,s:0,msg:'和等于 0：<strong>记录 [-1,-1,2]</strong>，并跨过重复值',n:1},{i:1,l:3,r:4,s:0,msg:'再次等于 0：<strong>记录 [-1,0,1]</strong>',n:2},{i:2,l:3,r:5,s:1,msg:'固定值 -1 与上一轮重复：<strong>跳过整个固定点</strong>',n:2},{i:3,l:4,r:5,s:3,msg:'固定值已大于 0，后面的数更大：<strong>可以结束</strong>',n:2}];const array=document.getElementById('array');nums.forEach((v,k)=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='slot';e.innerHTML='<div class=\"tag\"></div><div class=\"cell\">'+v+'</div><div class=\"idx\">索引 '+k+'</div>';array.appendChild(e)});let p=0;function show(){const f=frames[p];[...array.children].forEach((e,k)=>{e.className='slot';e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='';if(k===f.i){e.classList.add('fixed');e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='i'}if(k===f.l){e.classList.add('left');e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='L'}if(k===f.r){e.classList.add('right');e.querySelector('.tag').textContent='R'}});document.getElementById('step').textContent='步骤 '+(p+1)+' / '+frames.length;document.getElementById('bar').style.width=((p+1)/frames.length*100)+'%';document.getElementById('sum').textContent=nums[f.i]+' + '+nums[f.l]+' + '+nums[f.r]+' = '+f.s;document.getElementById('reason').innerHTML=f.msg;document.getElementById('a1').classList.toggle('on',f.n>=1);document.getElementById('a2').classList.toggle('on',f.n>=2);p=(p+1)%frames.length}show();setInterval(show,1800);</script></body></html>","svg":"","media":""}
